{"publicId":"69086d7c-be87-476c-b878-f374050856d2","title":"ApeChain因LayerZero桥攻击损失近3亿美元并迁移至Chainlink CCIP","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T16:36:42.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-04T16:36:42.000Z","digest":"ApeChain宣布因LayerZero桥安全漏洞导致$292M损失，将跨链基础设施迁移至Chainlink CCIP，并升级$APE、$USDC等资产为Chainlink跨链代币（CCT），以支持Yuga Labs生态（含Bored Ape Yacht Club）的跨链应用互通。当前未披露完整迁移时间表及旧桥关闭计划。（Crypto Briefing/PANews）\n\nChainlink CCIP因采用零知识证明和标准化合约设计被多机构推荐为更安全方案（据Chainlink官方数据），但未证实该升级是否完全消除桥接风险。（The Defiant）\n\n升级后资产需通过CCT实现跨链互通，但未明确持有者迁移的具体操作流程和旧桥服务终止时间。（The Defiant/PANews）","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T04:34:32.518Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"ApeChain宣布将跨链基础设施迁移至Chainlink CCIP","latestReport":{"id":"ktlkd259et155f58xkly0dx1d"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fLmyC8AV3xfQ","title":"ApeChain replaces LayerZero with Chainlink CCIP","firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T16:36:42.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ktlkd259et155f58xkly0dx1d","title":"ApeChain宣布将跨链基础设施迁移至Chainlink CCIP","summary":"ApeChain宣布因LayerZero桥被攻击导致$292M损失，将跨链基础设施迁移至Chainlink CCIP，并升级$APE和$USDC为CCTs以统一标准并降低桥接风险。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T16:36:42.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ktlkd259et155f58xkly0dx1d","title":"ApeChain宣布将跨链基础设施迁移至Chainlink CCIP","summary":"ApeChain宣布因LayerZero桥被攻击导致$292M损失，将跨链基础设施迁移至Chainlink CCIP，并升级$APE和$USDC为CCTs以统一标准并降低桥接风险。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T16:36:42.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T08:00:00.000Z","heat":19.5,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-05T09:00:00.000Z","heat":18.9,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-05T10:00:00.000Z","heat":18.4,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-05T11:00:00.000Z","heat":17.9,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-05T12:00:00.000Z","heat":17.4,"